      "before": "kpk1-l11-a5-e01",
      "title": {
        "en": "Moi rodzice"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "With men, or a group with a man in it, *my* is *moi*: *moi rodzice*, *moi dziadkowie*. *Czyli* says the same thing in other words: *brat mamy, czyli wujek*. *Lub* is another word for *albo* (or). A *drzewo genealogiczne* is a family tree, and a *stuprocentowa Polka* is Polish through and through."
      }
    }
  ],
